    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "3c0c7866d045c8678992": "I can tell just by the way you're standing that you're no warrior.  $B$BWhy don't you go do something safe, like read a book.",
        "404e6c181b05f94bc002": "I require warrior training.",
        "6adba07fa54ec0ac0b92": "May the Light protect you this day.",
        "a14d2d0488b3b878fd97": "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?",
        "d3cca132e46f718ee272": "Stormwind is the pillar of the human race, maintained through strength of will and the edge of a sturdy blade."
      },
      "name": "Lyria Du Lac",
      "subName": "Warrior Trainer",
      "translationMetadata": {
